      "Upload, download, search, clone, organize, archive, and remove DNAnexus data objects.",
      "Launch, monitor, chain, retry, and terminate jobs and workflows through dxpy or the command line.",
      "Apply dxpy handlers, links, API methods, error handling, and project context patterns."
